<title>USA: Duracell Q1 oper share rises to $0.53.</title>
<headline>Duracell Q1 oper share rises to $0.53.</headline>
<dateline>BETHEL, Conn. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr primary $0.53		    $0.48</p>
<p> Oper net	   63,800		   58,100</p>
<p> Revs		 596,900		  538,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary 121,200		  120,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current quarter figures exclude an unrealized accounting gain of $2 million, or $0.01 per share, from the &quot;mark-to-market&quot; adjustment versus a loss of $5 million, or $0.04 per share, for the adjustment in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>Full company name is Duracell International Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
